  "version": "other",
  "operative_text": "(a_in_person_id) not stated.\n(b_no_id_remedy) not stated.\n(c_mail_ballot_id) not stated.\n(d_proof_of_citizenship)\n(section) Recital (WHEREAS clauses)\n(quote) WHEREAS, The SAVE Act requires states to obtain proof of citizenship in person when registering a person to vote; and WHEREAS, The SAVE Act requires states to remove noncitizens from existing voter rolls;\n(section) Resolving clause\n(quote) RESOLVED, That we, the members of 135th General Assembly of the State of Ohio, in adopting this resolution, urge the United States Congress to quickly enact the SAVE Act;\n(e_other_rule) not stated.\n(other) Second resolving clause: the House clerk sends copies of the resolution to the U.S. Senate and House leaders, Ohio's congressional delegation and the news media.\n(other) version: 00_IN, 01_RH, 02_AH: same resolution text; only the cosponsor list and header differ.\n(other) note: A concurrent resolution that urges Congress to pass the federal SAVE Act. It changes no Ohio law. The slot d quotes are a recital about what the SAVE Act requires (documentary proof of citizenship to register) and the clause that urges Congress to enact it. Only the House voted (adopted 2024-12-18); the Senate did not act. The vote was on the House committee version (01_RH), whose text matches 02_AH.",
